  "finding": "Independent review (2026-09-10, /Users/casey.allard/Documents/Codex/2026-09-10/uor-r4-claude-review) confirmed that the named fallback logs are zero or six bytes: the drivers print only a one-line count, so those logs cannot preserve the rejected candidate's row-level reports. The recoverability part of the original statement was inaccurate.",
  "corrected_statement": "The fourteen older behavior/control reports produced for the rejected candidate d6144304 (labels preserve-*-2, 2026-09-10T05:19 to 05:24 UTC) under validation/validation-final, and the word/Rust retained report under validation/word-fresh-retained, were overwritten in place when the same output paths were reused for the retained candidate e3a906c8 (labels preserve-*-3, 06:03 to 06:08 UTC). Their original row-level contents are not recoverable from any surviving file: the preserve-*-2 logs hold at most a one-line exact/total count. What survives of the rejected candidate: its artifact and fit receipt, its construction/opened/independent-draw evaluations, its retained-handoff-fresh-2 regression report, its matched-history replay (validation/history), its Copy/Add and action reports (validation/*-final) and its generated word/Rust checks (validation/rust-retained), each carrying the d6144304 artifact identity. The retained e3a906c8 reports at the overwritten paths are complete and internally consistent. Neither complete recovery nor total loss of rejection evidence is claimed.",
  "no_backup_found": "Read-only search performed in the repair cycle: `tmutil listlocalsnapshots /` lists no local snapshots; a search for the rejected artifact identity d6144304 in every JSON file under /Users/casey.allard/Documents/Codex/2026-09-09, /Users/casey.allard/Documents/Codex/2026-09-10, /Users/casey.allard/Downloads/uor-r4-project and the repository docs found no copy of the fourteen older reports or of the word/Rust report outside the run root; the only file outside the run root naming that identity is the original evidence snapshot itself. Inside the run root the files still carrying that identity are the rejected artifact and fit receipt, construction-result-8, opened-fresh-result-3, fresh-result-2, retained-query-owner, retained-historical, retained-handoff-fresh (with its rejection receipt), selected-probe, selection-2/3, history-analog-trace, validation/history, validation/copy-add-*-final, validation/action-*-final, validation/rust-retained and the rust-evaluate/rust-stress source receipts. No file is identified as an original of the overwritten reports. No reconstruction by rerunning d6144304 was performed in this cycle; if one is performed later it must be labeled new reconstructed evidence with its own source/binary/run/resource provenance.",
